# expect-error: is not a closure conforming to the [Proc …]
# A FORWARD reference to a proc whose signature does NOT conform is rejected: the
# typer's portable stamp carries the proc's real signature, so the conformance
# fallback still catches the mismatch (here i32->i32 vs the f32->f32 param).
proc run [[Proc [f32] f32] f, f32 n] f32 [ [f $n] ]
proc main [] [ print [run $dbl 5.0] ]
proc dbl [i32 x] i32 [ [* $x 2] ]
main
